1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,113
Inventory tab mein aapko poora stock dikhta hai item name quantity ABC category

2
00:00:05,113 --> 00:00:06,513
stock group.

3
00:00:06,513 --> 00:00:08,260
ABC categorisation kya hai?

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:12,596
A category — top 20 percent items jo 80 percent revenue laate hain.

5
00:00:12,596 --> 00:00:13,996
Focus items.

6
00:00:13,996 --> 00:00:15,396
B category — middle.

7
00:00:15,396 --> 00:00:16,796
C category — bottom.

8
00:00:16,796 --> 00:00:20,097
D category — dead stock, jo bahut kam bik raha hai.

9
00:00:20,097 --> 00:00:24,240
Stock groups Tally se aate hain Engine Oil Gear Oil Transmission

10
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,634
apne group ke hisab se filter kariye.

11
00:00:26,634 --> 00:00:28,900
Reorder alerts bhi yaha dikhte hain

12
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:34,595
jab bhi kisi item ka stock reorder level se neeche jaata hai red highlight ho jaata hai.

13
00:00:34,595 --> 00:00:37,991
Export bhi kar sakte hain PDF ya Excel mein — company name banner ke saath.
